[{"id":2703720775,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hJ4FH","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?u=a04daf8c4d579b733ac46d2e4d17324cca7870c0&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","login":"kleonc","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc"},"body":"> The problem can be most easily understood with the scenario where one of the control points is collinear with the anchor points and the other is not. In this case the control points form a quadratic bezier curve but is treated as a linear curve.\r\n\r\n[`(A, B, C, D)` cubic bezier curve is quadratic only if `D - A == 3(C - B)`.](https://math.stackexchange.com/a/2759963)\r\nMeaning your example curve (_\"one of the control points is collinear with the anchor points and the other is not\"_) can't be quadratic, it's still cubic (if 3 of the points would be collinear and the curve would be quadratic, the above would imply that all 4 points must be collinear).\r\n\r\nE.g. the curve from the added test:\r\n```\r\nA = (0, 0, 1)\r\nB = (1, 0, 1)\r\nC = (1, 0, 0)\r\nD = (1, 0, 0)\r\n```\r\nhas equation `P(t) = (1, 0, 2) * t^3 - (3, 0, 3) * t^2 + (3, 0, 0) * t + (0, 0, 1)`. It's cubic.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNevertheless, the fix looks good to me, thanks! :+1:\r\n\r\nI'd just remove misleading comments from the added test.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104221#pullrequestreview-2703720775","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104221","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-20T18:33:58Z"},{"id":2705611443,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hRFqz","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104221#pullrequestreview-2705611443","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104221","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-21T11:31:51Z"},{"id":2688621029,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6gQRnl","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104221#pullrequestreview-2688621029","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104221","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-21T13:17:53Z"},{"id":2707866341,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hZsLl","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/519151?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Teschnique","id":519151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTE1MQ==","login":"Teschnique","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104221#pullrequestreview-2707866341","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104221","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-22T06:06:27Z"},{"id":2708414011,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hbx47","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"a6dc34541500fe5509a9b590fb5e5a895bac99ba","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Code looks good to me.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104221#pullrequestreview-2708414011","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104221","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-23T01:09:17Z"}]